      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.39.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Joseph was brought down to Egypt: and Potiphar, an officer of Pharaoh, captain of the guard, an Egyptian, bought him of the hands of the Ishmaelites, who had brought him down thither.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.39.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.39.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the LORD was with Joseph, and he was a prosperous man: and he was in the house of his master the Egyptian.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.39.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.39.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And his master saw that the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " with him, and that the LORD made all that he did to prosper in his hand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.39.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.39.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Joseph found grace in his sight, and he served him: and he made him overseer over his house, and all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he had he put into his hand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.39.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.39.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass from the time ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he had made him overseer in his house, and over all that he had, that the LORD blessed the Egyptian's house for Joseph's sake: and the blessing of the LORD was on all that he had in the house, and in the field.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.39.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.39.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he left all that he had in Joseph's hand; and he knew not aught he had, save the bread which he ate; and Joseph was ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "a",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " goodly ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "person",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and well favored.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.39.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.39.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass after these things, that his master's wife cast her eyes upon Joseph: and she said, Lie with me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
