      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.39.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass, when his master heard the words of his wife, which she spoke to him, saying, After this manner did thy servant to me; that his wrath was kindled.",
